  "coverageNote": "Partial collection: 339 of 341 numbered hymns. Omitted 26 and 223: they contain a lost character (U+FFFD) in both the pinned JSON and its VideoPsalm package. Source numbering is retained. Print edition year not established; independent lyric review pending. No verified media attached.",
